---
import CatalogFilters from "../components/CatalogFilters";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Stakeholder-Guided APIOps Cycles Method" canonicalPath="/">
  <main class="public-content">
    <section class="public-hero">
      <p class="public-kicker">APIOps Cycles public beta</p>
      <h1>Stakeholder-Guided APIOps Cycles Method</h1>
      <p>Explore the APIOps Cycles method as cycle journeys, stations, stakeholder guides, and reusable resources.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="public-section" aria-labelledby="catalog-heading">
      <h2 id="catalog-heading">Knowledge catalog</h2>
      <p>The route-by-route Astro migration is underway. The beta application remains available while static route and feature parity are verified.</p>
      <CatalogFilters client:load />
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
